        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Something alive is wearing you, and it grows by eating. Not by levelling &mdash; by <strong>eating</strong>. Feed it a ruby and it learns to burn. Feed it iron and the limbs get heavier and longer. Feed it nickel and you do not know what you will have on Tuesday, and neither does it.</p><p>Your build is not a list of choices made at character creation. It is a <strong>stomach</strong>, and its contents are visible on you.</p><p><strong>Key attribute</strong> Strength or Dexterity &middot; <strong>Hit Points</strong> 10 + Constitution modifier per level &middot; <strong>Class DC</strong> the Assimilator DC</p>"
        },
